<rml>
<head>
	<title>Master Skill Tree Background</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="master_level_bg.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Background-context companion of master_level.rml (see npc_shop_bg.rml for the mechanism): the
     part of the tree that must stay UNDER the bottom HUD. The original stretches its 428-high
     background art from power-of-two textures without cropping, so the texture's black padding
     covers the screen from reference y 428 down, with the HUD drawn over it. Pushed behind every
     other background document (CMasterLevel::SyncBackgroundVisibility()). No data model: the band
     is a fixed fraction of the screen. -->
<body>
	<div id="band"></div>
</body>
</rml>
